-                   "user_code": "WDJB-MJHT",
-                   "verification_uri": "https://example.com/device",
-                   "verification_uri_complete":
-                       "https://example.com/device?user_code=WDJB-MJHT",
-                   "expires_in": 1800,
-                   "interval": 5
-                 }
-
-           .. _`Section-3.2`: https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8628#section-3.2
